      "writtenOn": "2025-04-23T05:11:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "how about just redefining them in [zephyr/program/fpmcu/Kconfig](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/fpmcu/Kconfig) under `if CONFIG_HELIPLOT`\n\n```\nif BOARD_HELIPILOT\n\nconfig CROS_EC_RW_SIZE\n\thex \"The size of the RW region\"\n\tdefault $(dt_node_int_prop_hex,/binman/ec-rw,size)\n```\n\nI tested it and it works. Then we do not have to worry about the other boards because this redefinition is only for fpmcu\n\n```\nCONFIG_CROS_EC_RW_SIZE\u003d0x50000\n```",
